  "title": "Draft: Show IP addresses in Interface List",
  "description": "When there are many interfaces on a system, it's difficult to tell which interface a user should select.\n\nRecent changes show active interfaces first, but it can still be hard (especially for new users), to know which has the relevant traffic.\n\nThis change adds a column between the Interface name and the graph, to show the IP addresses assigned to the interface.\n\nExample:\n\n![image](/uploads/ce229dc571ff5d0ca11e40a63fe415bd/image.png)",
